  "introduction": "{$greeting} I'm Patrick Kollitsch, known as [David's Neighbour](https://davidsneighbour.dev/), a full-stack web developer and online business consultant for small and medium sized companies. I am known for building fast, flexible websites from my home office on the beautiful island of Koh Samui in Thailand. Yep, the one with the palm trees, white sand beaches, turquoise waters, and scooters that you know from the [White Lotus'ses third season](https://www.imdb.com/title/tt13406094/episodes/?season=3).\n\n[KOLLITSCH.dev*](https://kollitsch.dev/) is where smart code meets island life. I use [Astro](https://astro.build/), [GoHugo](https://gohugo.io/), [WordPress](https://wordpress.org/), you name it, and a healthy dose of sunlight to craft websites that work hard, are usable, accessible, and fast. They also look darn good doing it.",
